angular.module('bestvisionWeb').controller('addPurchaseRequestCtrl', ['$scope', 'Popup', '$rootScope', '$timeout', '$state', 'ListFactory', 'ObjectFactory', function ($scope, Popup, $rootScope, $timeout, $state, ListFactory, ObjectFactory) {

    $scope.obj = {};
    $scope.purchase = {};
    $scope.tab = {};
    $scope.storehouseArr = [{ id: null, name: '全部仓库' }];
    $scope.obj.storehouseId = null;

    $scope.obj.status = 0;

    $scope.purchase.requestTime = moment(new Date()).add(7, 'days')._d;

    $scope.searchCategoryObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
    $scope.searchCategoryObjectFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/getCategoryTree2Level.json');

    $scope.getBrandFactory = new ObjectFactory();
    $scope.getBrandFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/getBrandListOfProduct.json');

    $scope.chooseCategory = function (id, bool) {
        $scope.obj.categoryId = id;
        $scope.seletedCategory = id;
        $scope.seletedCategoryId = null;

        if (bool) {
            $scope.categoryAll = true;
        } else {
            $scope.categoryAll = false;
        }
        $scope.searchStock();
    };
    $scope.chooseCategoryId = function (id, event) {
        event.stopPropagation();
        $scope.seletedCategoryId = id;
        $scope.obj.categoryId = id;
        $scope.searchStock();
    };
    $scope.pageSize = 20;
    $scope.searchStock = function () {

        $scope.getStockListFactory = new ListFactory('/admin/getProductSkuExistCountVoList.json', 0, $scope.pageSize, $scope.obj);
        var promise = $scope.getStockListFactory.nextPage();
        promise.then(function (data) {

            $scope.recompute();
            $("#Pagination").pagination($scope.getStockListFactory.count, {
                items_per_page: $scope.pageSize,
                callback: function callback(index) {

                    $scope.getStockListFactory.clearAndSetIndex(index * $scope.pageSize);
                    var nextPromise = $scope.getStockListFactory.nextPage();
                    nextPromise.then(function (resp) {
                        $scope.recompute();
                    });
                }
            });
        });
    };

    $scope.searchStock();

    $scope.totalCount = function () {
        var total = 0;

        if ($scope.viewFactory && $scope.viewFactory.result.list) {
            for (var i = 0; i < $scope.viewFactory.result.list.length; i++) {
                total = total + $scope.viewFactory.result.list[i].purchaseRequestSku.skuCount;
            }
            return total;
        }
    };

    $scope.recompute = function () {
        $timeout(function () {
            for (var i = 0, len = $scope.getStockListFactory.items.length; i < len; i++) {
                $scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].skuCount = null;

                for (var j = 0, jlen = $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length; j < jlen; j++) {
                    if ($scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].productSku.id == $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[j].skuId) {
                        $scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].skuCount = $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[j].skuCount;
                    }
                }
            }
        }, 200);
    };

    $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson = [];

    $scope.addInventory = function (skuCount, skuId, idx) {

        if (skuCount === null || skuCount === undefined) {

            $scope.getStockListFactory.items[idx].skuCount = null;

            var arr = [];
            for (var i = 0; i < $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length; i++) {
                if ($scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuId !== skuId) {
                    arr.push({
                        skuId: $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuId,
                        skuCount: $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuCount

                    });
                }
            }

            $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson = arr;

            return false;
        }

        if (skuCount <= 0) {
            Popup.notice('采购数量必须大于0');
            $scope.getStockListFactory.items[idx].skuCount = null;

            var arr = [];
            for (var i = 0; i < $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length; i++) {
                if ($scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuId !== skuId) {
                    arr.push({
                        skuId: $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuId,
                        skuCount: $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuCount

                    });
                }
            }

            $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson = arr;
        } else {
            for (var i = 0; i < $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length; i++) {
                if ($scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuId == skuId) {

                    $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuCount = skuCount;

                    return;
                }
            }

            $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.push({
                skuId: skuId,
                skuCount: skuCount

            });
        }
    };

    $scope.autoChange = function (count, id, idx) {

        if (count === null || count === undefined) {
            Popup.notice('数量不能为空');
            return false;
        }

        if (count <= 0) {
            Popup.notice('数量必须大于0');
            return false;
        } else {
            for (var i = 0; i < $scope.getStockListFactory.items.length; i++) {
                if ($scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].productSku.id == id) {
                    $scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].skuCount = count;
                }
            }
            for (var i = 0; i < $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length; i++) {
                if ($scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuId == id) {
                    $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuCount = count;
                }
            }
        }
    };

    $scope.preview = function () {

        var stringArr = [];
        for (var i = 0, len = $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length; i < len; i++) {
            for (var j = i + 1; j < len; j++) {
                if ($scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuId === $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[j].skuId) {
                    j = ++i;
                }
            };

            if ($scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuCount) {

                stringArr.push({

                    skuCount: $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuCount,
                    skuId: $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuId

                });
            }
        };

        if (!stringArr.length) {
            Popup.notice('请输入采购数量');
            return false;
        }

        $scope.viewFactory = new ObjectFactory();
        var viewPromise = $scope.viewFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/viewPurchaseRequestSkuVoList.json', { purchaseRequestSkuListJson: JSON.stringify(stringArr) });
        viewPromise.then(function (res) {
            $scope.addProductModal = true;
        });
    };

    $scope.hideProductModal = function () {
        $scope.addProductModal = false;
    };

    $scope.setTab = function () {
        $scope.setAllModal = true;
        $scope.tab.count = null;
    };

    $scope.setCountTab = function () {
        $scope.setModal = true;

        $scope.tab.purchaseCount = null;
    };

    $scope.setProduct = function (count) {
        if (count <= 0) {
            Popup.notice('数量必须大于0');
            return false;
        }

        for (var i = 0; i < $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length; i++) {

            $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[i].skuCount = count;
        }
        for (var i = 0; i < $scope.viewFactory.result.list.length; i++) {

            $scope.viewFactory.result.list[i].purchaseRequestSku.skuCount = count;
        }

        for (var j = 0; j < $scope.getStockListFactory.items.length; j++) {

            for (var k = 0; k < $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length; k++) {

                if ($scope.getStockListFactory.items[j].productSku.id == $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[k].skuId) {
                    console.log('ok');
                    $scope.getStockListFactory.items[j].skuCount = count;
                }
            }
        }

        $scope.setModal = false;
    };

    $scope.setAllProduct = function (count) {

        if (count <= 0) {
            Popup.notice('数量必须大于0');
            return false;
        }

        var len = $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.length;

        for (var i = 0; i < $scope.getStockListFactory.items.length; i++) {
            $scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].skuCount = count;

            if (len) {
                for (var k = 0; k < len; k++) {

                    if ($scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].productSku.id == $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[k].skuId) {

                        $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson[k].skuCount = count;
                    } else {
                        $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.push({
                            skuCount: count,

                            skuId: $scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].productSku.id
                        });
                    }
                }
            } else {
                $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson.push({
                    skuCount: count,

                    skuId: $scope.getStockListFactory.items[i].productSku.id
                });
            }
        }

        $scope.setAllModal = false;
    };
    $scope.addPurchase = function () {

        var stringArr = [];
        var arr = $scope.stockTakingSkuListJson;
        for (var i = 0, len = arr.length; i < len; i++) {
            for (var j = i + 1; j < len; j++) {
                if (arr[i].skuId === arr[j].skuId) {
                    j = ++i;
                }
            };

            if (arr[i].skuCount < 0) {
                Popup.notice('数量请输入正整数');
                return false;
            }

            if (arr[i].skuCount) {
                stringArr.push({
                    skuId: arr[i].skuId,
                    skuCount: arr[i].skuCount

                });
            }
        };

        if (!stringArr.length) {
            Popup.notice('请至少采购一个商品');
            return false;
        }

        $scope.purchase.purchaseRequestSkuListJson = JSON.stringify(stringArr);
        $scope.saveInventoryObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
        var promiseSave = $scope.saveInventoryObjectFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/createPurchaseRequestAndSkuList.json', $scope.purchase);
        promiseSave.then(function (res) {
            if (res.status == 0) {
                Popup.notice('新建成功', 2000, function () {});
                $state.go('materialPurchaseRequest');
            } else {
                Popup.notice(res.errmsg, 2000, function () {});
            };
        });
    };
}]);
