angular.module("bestvisionWeb").controller("materialPurchaseCtrl", ["$scope", "Popup", "HttpFactory", "$timeout", "DateUtilFactory", "StorageFactory", "$state", "ListFactory", "ObjectFactory", function ($scope, Popup, HttpFactory, $timeout, DateUtilFactory, StorageFactory, $state, ListFactory, ObjectFactory) {
  $scope.getLinkCodeFactory = new ObjectFactory();
  $scope.getLinkCodeFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getChildrenLinkAndCode.json", { state: "goods" });

  $scope.isCheck = function (str) {
    var status = false;
    if ($scope.getLinkCodeFactory.result.object && $scope.getLinkCodeFactory.result.object.childrenCode.indexOf(str) > -1) {
      status = true;
    }
    return status;
  };
  var store = JSON.parse(StorageFactory.getItem("materialPurchase"));
  $scope.obj = store ? store : {};
  $scope.obj.supplierId = $scope.obj.supplierId ? $scope.obj.supplierId : null;
  $scope.obj.keyword = $scope.obj.keyword ? $scope.obj.keyword : "";
  $scope.checkStatus = $scope.obj.checked = $scope.obj.checked !== null ? $scope.obj.checked : null;
  $scope.obj.id = $scope.obj.id ? $scope.obj.id : null;
  if ($scope.obj.startTime) {
    $scope.obj.startTime = new Date($scope.obj.startTime);
  }
  if ($scope.obj.rightTime) {
    $scope.rightTime = new Date($scope.obj.rightTime);
  }
  if ($scope.obj.supplierId) {
    $scope.getSupplierFactory = new ObjectFactory();
    $scope.getSupplierFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getSupplier.json", {
      id: $scope.obj.supplierId
    });
  }
  $scope.companyFactory = new ObjectFactory();
  $scope.companyFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getCorpInfo.json");

  var url = "/admin/getStockPurchaseVoList.json";

  $scope.clearPage = function () {
    $scope.obj.page = 0;
    $scope.obj.index = 0;
    $scope.searchStock();
  };

  /* $scope.getPurchaseRequestCountListFactory = new ListFactory(
    "/admin/getPurchaseRequestVoList.json",
    0,
    0,
    { checked: 1, processStatus: 0 }
  );
  $scope.getPurchaseRequestCountListFactory.nextPage(); */

  $scope.pageSize = 10;
  $scope.searchStock = function () {
    var pageStart = $scope.obj.page ? $scope.obj.page * $scope.pageSize : 0;

    if ($scope.obj.startTime && $scope.rightTime) {
      $scope.obj.startTime = DateUtilFactory.origin($scope.obj.startTime);
      $scope.obj.endTime = DateUtilFactory.plus($scope.rightTime);
    } else if ($scope.obj.startTime && !$scope.rightTime) {
      $scope.obj.startTime = DateUtilFactory.origin($scope.obj.startTime);
      delete $scope.obj.endTime;
    } else if (!$scope.obj.startTime && $scope.rightTime) {
      $scope.obj.endTime = DateUtilFactory.plus($scope.rightTime);
      delete $scope.obj.startTime;
    } else {}
    StorageFactory.setItem("materialPurchase", JSON.stringify($scope.obj));
    $scope.getStockListFactory = new ListFactory(url, pageStart, 10, $scope.obj);
    var promise = $scope.getStockListFactory.nextPage();
    promise.then(function (data) {
      // console.log(data);
      // $scope.multipleChoose.nextPage()
      $("#Pagination").pagination($scope.getStockListFactory.count, {
        items_per_page: $scope.pageSize,
        current_page: $scope.obj.page,
        callback: function callback(index) {
          $scope.obj.page = index;
          StorageFactory.setItem("materialPurchase", JSON.stringify($scope.obj));
          $scope.getStockListFactory.clearAndSetIndex(index * $scope.pageSize);
          $scope.getStockListFactory.nextPage().then($scope.multipleChoose.nextPage);
        }
      });
    });
  };
  $scope.searchStock();
  $scope.multipleChoose = {
    isAll: false, //是否全选中
    disabledClick: true, //可否点击删除
    multiChooseList: [],
    clearStatus: function clearStatus() {
      this.isAll = false;
      this.disabledClick = true;
      this.multiChooseList = [];
    },
    checkAll: function checkAll() {
      var _this = this;

      $scope.getStockListFactory.items.forEach(function (v, i) {
        if (v.stockPurchase.checked == 0) {
          _this.multiChooseList[i + $scope.getStockListFactory.index - $scope.pageSize] = _this.isAll ? v.stockPurchase.id : null;
        }
      });
      var choseList = this.multiChooseList.filter(function (v) {
        return v;
      });
      this.disabledClick = !choseList.length;
    },
    choseSingle: function choseSingle() {
      var _this2 = this;

      var arrLabel = [];
      $scope.getStockListFactory.items.forEach(function (v, i) {
        var nowIndex = i + $scope.getStockListFactory.index - $scope.pageSize;
        if (_this2.multiChooseList[nowIndex]) {
          arrLabel.push(_this2.multiChooseList[nowIndex]);
        }
      });
      var choseList = this.multiChooseList.filter(function (v) {
        return v;
      });
      this.disabledClick = !choseList.length;
      this.isAll = arrLabel.length == $scope.getStockListFactory.items.length;
    },
    nextPage: function nextPage() {
      var count = $scope.getStockListFactory.items.reduce(function (pre, next, index) {
        if (next.stockPurchase.id == $scope.multipleChoose.multiChooseList[index + $scope.getStockListFactory.index - $scope.pageSize]) {
          pre += 1;
        }
        return pre;
      }, 0);
      $scope.multipleChoose.isAll = count == $scope.getStockListFactory.items.length;
    },
    batchAudit: function batchAudit() {
      Popup.confirm("确认批量审核采购单？", function () {
        var stockPurchaseIdArray = $scope.multipleChoose.multiChooseList.filter(function (v) {
          return v;
        });
        HttpFactory.object("/admin/commitStockPurchaseList.json", { stockPurchaseIdArray: stockPurchaseIdArray }).then(function () {
          Popup.notice("审核成功");
          $scope.multipleChoose.clearStatus();
          $scope.searchStock();
        });
      });
    }
  };
  $scope.deleteStock = function (id) {
    Popup.confirm("确认删除么", function () {
      $scope.deleteObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
      var promise = $scope.deleteObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/deleteStockPurchase.json", { stockPurchaseId: id });
      promise.then(function (res) {
        if (res.status == 1) {
          Popup.notice(res.errmsg, 2000, function () {});
        } else {
          Popup.notice("删除成功", 2000, function () {});
          $scope.searchStock();
        }
      });
    }, function () {});
  };

  $scope.$watch("obj.supplierId", function (newValue, oldValue) {
    $scope.searchStock();
  });

  $scope.anotherRequest = function (id) {
    Popup.confirm("确定再来一单么", function () {
      $scope.resendPurchaseObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
      var anotherpromise = $scope.resendPurchaseObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/reCreateStockPurchaseAndSkuList.json", { stockPurchaseId: id });

      anotherpromise.then(function (res) {
        if (res.status == 0) {
          Popup.notice("创建成功");
          $state.go("purchase.purchaseModify", { purchaseId: res.result.object.id });
        } else {
          Popup.notice(res.errmsg, 2000, function () {});
        }
      });
    }, function () {});
  };
  /* 
      checked: 0:未审核 1:已审核 2:已作废
      allIn:0:未入库 1:部分入库 2:已入库
  */
  $scope.setTab = function (idx) {
    $scope.checkStatus = idx;
    if (idx == 0) {
      $scope.obj.checked = 0;
      $scope.obj.allIn = null;
    } else if (idx == 1) {
      $scope.obj.checked = 1;
      $scope.obj.allIn = 0;
    } else if (idx == 2) {
      $scope.obj.checked = 1;
      $scope.obj.allIn = 1;
    } else if (idx == 3) {
      $scope.obj.checked = 1;
      $scope.obj.allIn = 2;
    } else if (idx == 4) {
      $scope.obj.checked = 2;
      $scope.obj.allIn = 0;
    } else {
      $scope.obj.checked = null;
      $scope.obj.allIn = null;
    }
    $scope.clearPage();
  };
  $scope.cancelStockPurchase = function (stockPurchase) {
    Popup.confirm("确认作废么", function () {
      HttpFactory.object("/admin/cancelStockPurchase.json", { stockPurchaseId: stockPurchase.stockPurchase.id }).then(function (res) {
        Popup.notice("作废成功");
        $scope.searchStock();
      });
    });
  };
  $scope.obj.productType = null;
  $scope.setType = function (idx) {
    $scope.typeStatus = idx;
    $scope.obj.productType = idx;

    $scope.clearPage();
  };

  $scope.companyFactory = new ObjectFactory();
  $scope.companyFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getCorpInfo.json");
  $scope.printList = function (id) {
    $scope.getCashflowObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
    var promise = $scope.getCashflowObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getStockPurchaseVo.json", { stockPurchaseId: id });
    promise.then(function (res) {
      $scope.totalCount = 0;
      for (var i = 0; i < res.result.object.skuList.length; i++) {
        $scope.totalCount = $scope.totalCount + res.result.object.skuList[i].stockPurchaseSku.skuCount;
      }

      $timeout(function () {
        $("#ele3").jqprint({
          debug: false,
          importCSS: true,
          printContainer: true,
          operaSupport: false
        });
      }, 1000);
    });
  };
}]);
'use strict';

angular.module('bestvisionWeb').controller('materialPurchaseBackGoodsCtrl', ['$scope', '$stateParams', 'Popup', '$rootScope', '$timeout', 'DateUtilFactory', "StorageFactory", '$state', 'ListFactory', 'ObjectFactory', function ($scope, $stateParams, Popup, $rootScope, $timeout, DateUtilFactory, StorageFactory, $state, ListFactory, ObjectFactory) {

    // 退货or修改
    //出库单id
    $scope.stockPurchaseOutId = parseInt($stateParams.stockPurchaseOutId);
    $scope.storehouseId = parseInt($stateParams.storehouseId);

    // 渲染的列表
    $scope.stockInSkuList = [];
    var stockOutSkuListJson = [];
    $scope.create = {
        stockOutDate: new Date(),
        remark: '',
        stockPurchaseOutId: $scope.stockPurchaseOutId,
        storehouseId: $scope.storehouseId,
        productType: '',
        stockPurchaseOutSkuListJson: ''
    };
    $scope.toutle = {
        num: 0,
        money: 0
    };
    $scope.supplierName = '';
    $scope.storeName = '';
    // 获取仓库名字
    $scope.getCangKuName = function () {
        $scope.getCangKuNameFactory = new ObjectFactory();
        var getCangKuNameFactoryPromise = $scope.getCangKuNameFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/getStorehouseVo.json', { id: $scope.storehouseId });
        getCangKuNameFactoryPromise.then(function (res) {
            console.log(res);
            $scope.storeName = res.object.storehouse.name;
            console.log('==================');
        });
    }();
    // 获取列表数据
    $scope.backGoods = function () {
        var backGoodsFactory = new ObjectFactory();
        var backGoodsFactoryPromise = backGoodsFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/getStockPurchaseOutSkuList.json', { stockPurchaseOutId: $scope.stockPurchaseOutId, getSkuList: true });
        backGoodsFactoryPromise.then(function (res) {
            $scope.newDate = new Date();
            console.log(res);
            console.log('dsafdsafdsafdsafdsa');
            $scope.create.stockOutDate = res.result.object.stockPurchaseOut.stockOutDate;
            $scope.create.remark = res.result.object.stockPurchaseOut.remark;
            $scope.supplierName = res.result.object.supplier.supplierName;
            $scope.create.productType = res.result.object.stockPurchaseOut.productType;
            $scope.create.storehouseId = res.result.object.stockPurchaseOut.storehouseId;
            for (var i = 0; i < res.result.object.skuList.length; i++) {
                $scope.stockInSkuList.push({
                    brandName: res.result.object.skuList[i].brand.brandName,
                    categoryName: res.result.object.skuList[i].category.categoryName,
                    productName: res.result.object.skuList[i].product.productName,
                    marketPrice: res.result.object.skuList[i].productSku.marketPrice,
                    unitName: res.result.object.skuList[i].productSku.unitName,
                    skuCode: res.result.object.skuList[i].product.productCode,
                    model1: res.result.object.skuList[i].productSku.model1,
                    model1Name: res.result.object.skuList[i].product.model1Name,
                    model2: res.result.object.skuList[i].productSku.model2,
                    model2Name: res.result.object.skuList[i].product.model2Name,
                    unLockExistSkuCount: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockInSku.skuCount - res.result.object.skuList[i].stockInSku.skuOutCount - res.result.object.skuList[i].stockInSku.skuLockCount,
                    skuPrice: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockInSku.skuPrice,
                    outCount: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockPurchaseOutSku.outCount,
                    outSkuPrice: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockPurchaseOutSku.outSkuPrice,
                    batchNo: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockInSku.batchNo,
                    expiresDateLong: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockInSku.expiresDate,
                    productionDateLong: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockInSku.productionDate
                });
                stockOutSkuListJson.push({ stockInSkuId: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockInSku.id, outCount: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockPurchaseOutSku.outCount, outSkuPrice: res.result.object.skuList[i].stockPurchaseOutSku.outSkuPrice });
            }
            $scope.create.stockPurchaseOutSkuListJson = JSON.stringify(stockOutSkuListJson);
            $scope.getToutle();
        });
    };
    $scope.backGoods();
    $scope.getToutle = function () {
        $scope.toutle.num = 0;
        $scope.toutle.money = 0;
        for (var j = 0; j < $scope.stockInSkuList.length; j++) {
            $scope.toutle.num += $scope.stockInSkuList[j].outCount;
            $scope.toutle.money += $scope.stockInSkuList[j].outSkuPrice * $scope.stockInSkuList[j].outCount;
        }
    };
    // 退货
    $scope.sureBackGoods = function () {
        if (!$scope.create.stockOutDate) {
            Popup.notice('请选择出库日期', 2000, function () {});
            return;
        }
        for (var i = 0; i < $scope.stockInSkuList.length; i++) {
            stockOutSkuListJson[i].outCount = $scope.stockInSkuList[i].outCount;
            stockOutSkuListJson[i].outSkuPrice = $scope.stockInSkuList[i].outSkuPrice;
        }
        $scope.create.stockOutDate = new Date($scope.create.stockOutDate);
        $scope.create.stockPurchaseOutSkuListJson = JSON.stringify(stockOutSkuListJson);
        $scope.addReceiptObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
        var promise = $scope.addReceiptObjectFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/updateStockPurchaseOutSkuList.json', $scope.create);
        promise.then(function (res) {
            if (res.status == 0) {
                var sureBackGoodsFactory = new ObjectFactory();
                var sureBackGoodsFactoryPromise = sureBackGoodsFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/commitStockPurchaseOut.json', { stockPurchaseOutId: $scope.stockPurchaseOutId });
                sureBackGoodsFactoryPromise.then(function (res) {
                    console.log(res);
                    if (res.status == 0) {
                        Popup.notice('退货成功');
                        $state.go('purchase.materialPurchaseReturn');
                    } else {
                        Popup.notice(res.errmsg);
                        return;
                    }
                });
            } else {
                Popup.notice(res.errmsg, 2000, function () {});
                return;
            };
        });
    };
    // 删除主内容列表项
    $scope.deleteReceipt = function (index) {
        $scope.stockInSkuList.splice(index, 1);
        stockOutSkuListJson.splice(index, 1);
    };
    // 保存
    $scope.saveDelivery = function () {
        if (!$scope.create.stockOutDate) {
            Popup.notice('请选择出库日期', 2000, function () {});
            return;
        }
        for (var i = 0; i < $scope.stockInSkuList.length; i++) {
            stockOutSkuListJson[i].outCount = $scope.stockInSkuList[i].outCount;
            stockOutSkuListJson[i].outSkuPrice = $scope.stockInSkuList[i].outSkuPrice;
        }
        $scope.create.stockOutDate = new Date($scope.create.stockOutDate);
        $scope.create.stockPurchaseOutSkuListJson = JSON.stringify(stockOutSkuListJson);
        $scope.addReceiptObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
        var promise = $scope.addReceiptObjectFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/updateStockPurchaseOutSkuList.json', $scope.create);
        promise.then(function (res) {
            if (res.status == 0) {
                Popup.notice('保存成功', 2000, function () {});
            } else {
                Popup.notice(res.errmsg, 2000, function () {});
            };
        });
    };
}]);
"use strict";

