angular.module("bestvisionWeb").controller("addCustomerChargeCtrl", ["$scope", "Popup", "CommonRequest", "ListFactory", "Utils", "ObjectFactory", "CommonRemark", "FirstApprovalConfig", function ($scope, Popup, CommonRequest, ListFactory, Utils, ObjectFactory, CommonRemark, FirstApprovalConfig) {
  $scope.CommonRemark = CommonRemark;
  $scope.unitNames = window.optionsObj.unitNames;
  $scope.modelNames = [{ id: "颜色", name: "颜色" }, { id: "度数", name: "度数" }, { id: "材质", name: "材质" }, { id: "重量", name: "重量" }, { id: "尺码", name: "尺码" }, { id: "规格", name: "规格" }, { id: "型号", name: "型号" }, { id: "设计", name: "设计" }, { id: "容量", name: "容量" }, { id: "疗程", name: "疗程" }, { id: "近视度数", name: "近视度数" }, { id: "散光度数", name: "散光度数" }, { id: "轴位", name: "轴位" }, { id: "功能", name: "功能" }];
  $scope.obj = {};
  $scope.obj.status = 0;
  $scope.obj.canBeDiscounted = 1;
  $scope.obj.allowPoints = 1;
  $scope.status = [{ id: 0, name: "正常" }, { id: 1, name: "停用" }];
  $scope.discounts = [{ id: 1, name: "是" }, { id: 0, name: "否" }];
  $scope.brandlist = false;
  $scope.keyword = "";

  $scope.parentId = "";

  $scope.obj.mainSupplierId = null;
  $scope.optUnitName = null;
  $scope.data = {};
  $scope.data.model1Name = null;
  $scope.data.model2Name = null;

  $scope.pageSize = 12;
  $scope.modelName = {};
  $scope.modelName.status = 0;
  $scope.search = function () {
    $scope.getModelNameListFactory = new ListFactory("/admin/selectModelNameVoList.json", 0, $scope.pageSize, $scope.modelName);
    var promise = $scope.getModelNameListFactory.nextPage();

    promise.then(function (data) {
      // console.log(data);
      $("#Pagination").pagination($scope.getModelNameListFactory.count, {
        items_per_page: $scope.pageSize,
        callback: function callback(index) {
          $scope.getModelNameListFactory.clearAndSetIndex(index * $scope.pageSize);
          $scope.getModelNameListFactory.nextPage();
        }
      });
    });
  };

  $scope.search();

  $scope.selected = [];
  //创建变量用来保存选中结果

  var updateSelected = function updateSelected(action, id) {
    if (action == "add" && $scope.selected.indexOf(id) == -1) {
      $scope.selected.push(id);
    }
    if (action == "remove" && $scope.selected.indexOf(id) != -1) {
      $scope.selected.splice($scope.selected.indexOf(id), 1);
    }
  };

  //全选操作
  $scope.selectAll = function ($event) {
    var checkbox = $event.target;
    var action = checkbox.checked ? "add" : "remove";
    for (var i = 0; i < $scope.getModelNameListFactory.items.length; i++) {
      var contact = $scope.getModelNameListFactory.items[i];
      updateSelected(action, contact.modelName.id);
    }
  };

  //更新某一列数据的选择
  $scope.updateSelection = function ($event, id) {
    var checkbox = $event.target;
    if (!checkbox.checked) {
      $scope.isSelectedAllStatus = false;
    }
    var action = checkbox.checked ? "add" : "remove";
    updateSelected(action, id);
  };
  $scope.count = 0;
  $scope.isSelectedAllStatus = true;
  $scope.isSelected = function (id) {
    if ($scope.selected.indexOf(id) < 0) {
      $scope.count = $scope.count + 1;
    }

    if ($scope.count) {
      $scope.isSelectedAllStatus = false;
    }
    return $scope.selected.indexOf(id) >= 0;
  };

  function swapArray(arr, index1, index2) {
    arr[index1] = arr.splice(index2, 1, arr[index1])[0];
    return arr;
  }

  $scope.deleteItem = function (idx) {
    $scope.selectedName.splice(idx, 1);
  };

  $scope.upMove = function (arr, index, length) {
    if (index != 0) {
      swapArray(arr, index, index - 1);
    } else {
      Popup.notice("已经处于置顶，无法上移");
    }
  };
  $scope.downMove = function (arr, index, length) {
    if (index + 1 != length) {
      swapArray(arr, index, index + 1);
    } else {
      Popup.notice("已经处于置底，无法下移");
    }
  };

  $scope.selectedName = [];
  $scope.addName = function () {
    if (!$scope.selected.length) {
      Popup.notice("请选择参数");
      return false;
    }
    // $scope.selectedName = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < $scope.selected.length; i++) {
      $scope.getSupplierObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
      var getSupplierPromise = $scope.getSupplierObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getModelNameVo.json", { modelNameId: $scope.selected[i] });
      getSupplierPromise.then(function (res) {
        $scope.selectedName.push({
          name: res.object.modelName.name,
          id: res.object.modelName.id
        });
        $scope.schoolModal = false;
      });
    }
  };

  $scope.searchCategoryObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
  $scope.searchCategoryObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getCategoryTree2Level.json");

  $scope.randomProductCodeObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
  var randomCodePromise = $scope.randomProductCodeObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/randomProductCode.json", { codeLength: 11 });
  randomCodePromise.then(function (res) {
    $scope.obj.productCode = res.result.object;
  });

  $scope.hideBrandlist = function () {
    $scope.brandlist = false;
  };

  $scope.searchModelList = function () {
    $scope.selected = [];
    $scope.schoolModal = true;
    $scope.isSelectedAllStatus = false;
    var arr = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < $scope.selectedName.length; i++) {
      arr[i] = $scope.selectedName[i].id;
    }
    $scope.modelName.notContainIdArray = arr;
    $scope.search();
  };

  $scope.modify = function () {
    if (!$scope.obj.productName) {
      Popup.notice("产品名称不能为空", 2000, function () {});
      return;
    }
    if (!$scope.obj.brandId) {
      Popup.notice("品牌不能为空", 2000, function () {});
      return;
    }
    if (!$scope.obj.categoryId) {
      Popup.notice("类目不能为空", 2000, function () {});
      return;
    }
    if (!$scope.obj.productCode) {
      Popup.notice("产品编码不能为空", 2000, function () {});
      return;
    }
    $scope.obj.skuCode = $scope.obj.productCode;
    if (!$scope.obj.unitName) {
      Popup.notice("单位不能为空", 2000, function () {});
      return;
    }

    if ($scope.obj.costPrice == null || $scope.obj.costPrice == undefined) {
      Popup.notice("请输入成本价", 3000, function () {});
      return;
    }

    if ($scope.obj.costPrice > 0) {
      if (!/^\d+(\.\d{1,2})?$/.test($scope.obj.costPrice)) {
        Popup.notice("成本价只能精确到2位小数", 3000, function () {});
        return false;
      }
    } else if ($scope.obj.costPrice == 0) {} else {
      Popup.notice("成本价不能小于0", 3000, function () {});
      return;
    }

    if ($scope.obj.marketPrice == null || $scope.obj.marketPrice == undefined) {
      Popup.notice("请输入零售价", 3000, function () {});
      return;
    }

    if ($scope.obj.marketPrice > 0) {
      if (!/^\d+(\.\d{1,2})?$/.test($scope.obj.marketPrice)) {
        Popup.notice("零售价只能精确到2位小数", 3000, function () {});
        return false;
      }
    } else if ($scope.obj.marketPrice == 0) {} else {
      Popup.notice("零售价不能小于0", 3000, function () {});
      return;
    }

    //  if (!$scope.selectedName.length) {
    //     Popup.notice('请添加参数', 2000, function() {});
    //     return;
    // };
    var productModelListJson = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < $scope.selectedName.length; i++) {
      productModelListJson[i] = {
        id: null,
        modelNameId: $scope.selectedName[i].id,
        rank1: i + 1
      };
    }

    var productSpecialItemJson = Utils.commonComponentFormat.get($scope.categoryItemVoList);
    $scope.obj.productSpecialItemJson = JSON.stringify(productSpecialItemJson);
    $scope.obj.productModelListJson = JSON.stringify(productModelListJson);
    $scope.createProductObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
    var promise = $scope.createProductObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/createProductAndModelList.json", $scope.obj);
    promise.then(function (res) {
      if (res.status == 1) {
        Popup.notice(res.errmsg, 2000, function () {});
      } else {
        sessionStorage.removeItem("customerCharge");
        Popup.notice("添加成功", 2000, function () {});
        var productId = res.object.productId;
        CommonRequest.isProductNeedFirstMarketCheck(productId, function (needCheck) {
          if (!needCheck) {
            return window.history.back();
          }
          $scope.firstApproval.setProductId(productId);
          $scope.firstApproval.onClose = function () {
            window.history.back();
          };
          $scope.firstApproval.open(true);
        });
      }
    });
  };

  $scope.showModalName = function (id) {
    $scope.modelNameModal = true;
    $scope.modelValeObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
    $scope.modelValeObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/selectModelValueList.json", { modelNameId: id });
  };
  //类目：查询类目下的特殊属性列表
  $scope.categoryItemVoList = [];

  $scope.selectCategoryItemVoList = function (categoryId) {
    CommonRequest.selectCategoryItemVoList(categoryId, function (res) {
      $scope.categoryItemVoList = res;
    });
  };

  $scope.selectCategory = function (arr, name, id) {
    $scope.selectCategoryItemVoList(id);
    $scope.categoryChildren = arr;
    // $scope.obj.categoryId = id;
    $scope.seletedCategory = id;
    // $scope.categoryName = name;
    if ($scope.parentId !== id) {
      $scope.parentId = id;
      $scope.obj.categoryId = id;
      $scope.categoryName = name;
      $scope.seletedCategoryId = "";
    }
  };
  $scope.selectCategoryId = function (categoryName, id) {
    $scope.categoryName = categoryName;
    $scope.obj.categoryId = id;
    $scope.seletedCategoryId = id;
    $scope.selectCategoryItemVoList(id);
  };
  $scope.hideCategory = function () {
    $scope.categoryModal = false;
  };
  $scope.showCategory = function () {
    $scope.categoryModal = true;
  };

  $scope.pinyin = function () {
    $scope.getpinyinObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
    var promise = $scope.getpinyinObjectFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getPinyin.json", { src: $scope.obj.productName });
    promise.then(function (res) {
      $scope.obj.pinyin = res.object;
    });
  };

  $scope.imgModal = false;

  $scope.chooseImg = function () {
    $scope.imgModal = true;
  };
  $scope.firstApproval = angular.copy(FirstApprovalConfig);
}]);
'use strict';

