angular.module('bestvisionWeb').controller('modifyProductPlanCtrl', ['$scope', '$stateParams', 'Popup', '$rootScope', '$timeout', '$state', 'ListFactory', 'ObjectFactory', function ($scope, $stateParams, Popup, $rootScope, $timeout, $state, ListFactory, ObjectFactory) {
    $scope.obj = {};

    $scope.obj.packageId = $stateParams.productId;
    $scope.obj.packageType = 2;
    $scope.checkItemIdArray = [];
    $scope.getPackageFactory = new ObjectFactory();
    $scope.examineArr = [];

    var packagePromise = $scope.getPackageFactory.saveOrQuery("/admin/getPackageVo.json", { packageId: $scope.obj.packageId });
    packagePromise.then(function (res) {
        $scope.obj.packageName = res.result.object.pkg.packageName;
        $scope.obj.status = res.result.object.pkg.status;
        // $scope.obj.packageRate = res.result.object.pkg.packageRate;
        $scope.itemArr = [];
        for (var i = 0; i < res.result.object.productPackageVoList.length; i++) {

            $scope.checkItemIdArray[i] = res.result.object.productPackageVoList[i].product.id;

            $scope.itemArr[i] = { examineName: res.result.object.productPackageVoList[i].product.productName, id: res.result.object.productPackageVoList[i].product.id, packageItemRate: res.result.object.productPackageVoList[i].productPackage.packageItemRate, packageItemCount: res.result.object.productPackageVoList[i].productPackage.packageItemCount };
        }
    });

    $scope.add = function () {

        if (!$scope.obj.packageName) {
            Popup.notice('套餐名称不能为空');
            return false;
        }

        var arr = [];
        for (var i = 0; i < $scope.itemArr.length; i++) {
            console.log($scope.itemArr);
            var itemrate = $scope.itemArr[i].packageItemRate;
            var itemcount = $scope.itemArr[i].packageItemCount;

            if (itemcount === '' || itemcount === null) {

                Popup.notice('套餐件数不能为空');
                return false;
            }
            if (itemcount > 0) {
                if (/^[1-9]\d*$/.test(itemcount)) {} else {
                    Popup.notice('商品件数必须为正整数', 3000, function () {});
                    return false;
                }
            } else if (itemcount == 0) {

                Popup.notice('商品件数必须为正整数', 3000, function () {});
                return false;
            } else {
                Popup.notice('商品件数必须为正整数', 3000, function () {});
                return false;
            }

            if (itemrate === '' || itemrate === null) {

                Popup.notice('套餐折扣不能为空');
                return false;
            }
            if (itemrate > 0) {
                if (/^[1-9]\d*$/.test(itemrate)) {
                    if (itemrate > 100) {
                        Popup.notice('商品折扣必须在100以内', 3000, function () {});
                        return false;
                    }
                } else {
                    Popup.notice('商品折扣必须为正整数', 3000, function () {});
                    return false;
                }
            } else if (itemrate == 0) {} else {
                Popup.notice('商品折扣必须为正整数', 3000, function () {});
                return false;
            }

            arr.push({
                productId: $scope.itemArr[i].id,
                packageItemRate: itemrate,
                packageItemCount: itemcount
            });
        }
        if (!arr.length) {
            Popup.notice('商品列表不能为空');
            return false;
        }
        $scope.obj.productPackageListJson = JSON.stringify(arr);

        $scope.adminObjectFactory = new ObjectFactory();
        var promise = $scope.adminObjectFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/updatePackage.json', $scope.obj);
        promise.then(function (res) {
            if (res.status == 0) {
                // $state.go('supplierList');
                window.history.back();
            } else {
                Popup.notice(res.errmsg, 3000, function () {});
            }
        });
    };

    $scope.checkItemIdRealArray = [];

    $scope.searchProductWord = function () {
        $scope.schoolListFactory = new ListFactory('/admin/getProductVoList.json', 0, 12, { status: 0, keyword: $scope.keyword, productType: 1 });
        var checkPromise = $scope.schoolListFactory.nextPage();
        checkPromise.then(function (res) {

            var pageSize = 12;
            $(".second-pagination").pagination($scope.schoolListFactory.count, {

                items_per_page: pageSize,

                callback: function callback(index) {

                    $scope.schoolListFactory.clearAndSetIndex(index * pageSize);
                    var promise = $scope.schoolListFactory.nextPage();
                    promise.then(function (resp) {
                        $scope.selectId($scope.schoolListFactory.index);
                    });
                }
            });
        });
    };
    $scope.selectId = function (idx) {
        $scope.isAll = true;

        var count = [];
        var arr = $scope.checkItemIdRealArray.slice(idx - 12, idx);

        for (var i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
            if (arr[i]) {
                count.push(arr[i]);
            }
        }

        if (count.length == $scope.schoolListFactory.items.length) {
            $scope.isAll = true;
        } else {
            $scope.isAll = false;
        }
    };

    $scope.checkAll = function () {

        if ($scope.isAll) {

            for (var i = 0; i < $scope.schoolListFactory.items.length; i++) {
                $scope.checkItemIdRealArray[i + $scope.schoolListFactory.index - 12] = $scope.schoolListFactory.items[i].product.id;
            }
        } else {

            for (var j = 0; j < $scope.schoolListFactory.items.length; j++) {
                $scope.checkItemIdRealArray[j + $scope.schoolListFactory.index - 12] = null;
            }
        }
    };
    $scope.exam = {};
    $scope.getItemList = function (id) {
        $scope.exam.examineId = id;
    };

    var getItemNameFactory;

    function unique(a) {
        var res = [];
        for (var i = 0, len = a.length; i < len; i++) {
            var item = a[i];
            if (res.indexOf(item) === -1) {
                res.push(item);
            }
        }
        return res;
    }

    $scope.modifyCheck = function () {

        var arr = [];
        var realArr = [];

        for (var k = 0; k < $scope.checkItemIdRealArray.length; k++) {

            // if ($scope.checkItemIdArray.indexOf($scope.checkItemIdRealArray[k]) == -1) {
            //     arr.push($scope.checkItemIdRealArray[k]);
            // }

            if ($scope.checkItemIdRealArray[k]) {
                arr.push($scope.checkItemIdRealArray[k]);
            }
        }

        for (var i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
            if (arr[i]) {

                getItemNameFactory = new ObjectFactory();
                var namePromise = getItemNameFactory.saveOrQuery('/admin/getProductVo.json', { productId: arr[i] });
                namePromise.then(function (res) {

                    $scope.itemArr.push({
                        examineName: res.result.object.product.productName,
                        id: res.result.object.product.id,
                        packageItemRate: 100,
                        packageItemCount: 1
                    });

                    $scope.checkItemIdArray.push(res.result.object.product.id);
                });
            }
        }

        $scope.schoolModal = false;
    };

    $scope.deleteItem = function (idx) {

        $scope.itemArr.splice(idx, 1);

        $scope.checkItemIdArray.splice(idx, 1);
    };

    $scope.showCheckModal = function () {
        $scope.schoolModal = true;
        $scope.checkItemIdRealArray = [];
        $scope.searchProductWord();
    };
}]);
"use strict";

